  "description": "The proposed works comprise the refurbishment and replacement of roof coverings to five existing canopies. All defective existing roof coverings will be stripped back prior to the installation of a new three‑layer, high‑performance hot‑bonded felt roofing system, consisting of a ventilation layer, underlay, and a charcoal grey mineral‑finished top layer. All roof perimeters will incorporate double‑welded drip details.\n\nNew Code 4 lead cover flashings will be installed to all abutment back walls as required.\n\nThe existing timber fascias and soffits to all five canopies will be capped with white uPVC fascia and soffit boards, including appropriate matching trims, to provide a clean and durable finish.\n\nOne canopy, which has been recently removed, will be rebuilt to match the design, materials, and appearance of the existing canopies, and will receive the same scope of works as described above.\n\nAll associated works will be carried out, with all waste materials removed from site upon completion. The site will be left clean, tidy, and free of debris.",
